 {
  "cells": [
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "# 01 数据概览（EDA）\n",
     "\n",
     "**目的**：在建模之前先了解数据长什么样——规模、类型、缺失、分布，以及目标变量的平衡程度。\n",
     "\n",
     "**数据**：`data/telco.csv`（Telco Customer Churn，7,043 行 × 21 列）\n",
     "\n",
     "> 本 notebook 只依赖 `pandas`，执行结果已写入下方各单元格，无需重跑即可阅读。\n"
    ],
    "id": "cac385aa"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 1,
    "metadata": {},
    "outputs": [
     {
      "output_type": "stream",
      "name": "stdout",
      "text": [
       "shape: (7043, 21)\n",
       "columns: ['customerID', 'gender', 'SeniorCitizen', 'Partner', 'Dependents', 'tenure', 'PhoneService', 'MultipleLines', 'InternetService', 'OnlineSecurity', 'OnlineBackup', 'DeviceProtection', 'TechSupport', 'StreamingTV', 'StreamingMovies', 'Contract', 'PaperlessBilling', 'PaymentMethod', 'MonthlyCharges', 'TotalCharges', 'Churn']\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "import pandas as pd\n",
     "\n",
     "pd.set_option(\"display.width\", 120)\n",
     "pd.set_option(\"display.max_columns\", 30)\n",
     "\n",
     "df = pd.read_csv(\"../data/telco.csv\")\n",
     "print(\"shape:\", df.shape)\n",
     "print(\"columns:\", list(df.columns))\n"
    ],
    "id": "4a30cc56"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 1. 字段类型与缺失情况\n",
     "\n",
     "`TotalCharges` 原始是**字符串**，需要转成数值；它也是唯一存在空白的字段。"
    ],
    "id": "331dc9df"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 2,
    "metadata": {},
    "outputs": [
     {
      "output_type": "stream",
      "name": "stdout",
      "text": [
       "                    dtype  missing\n",
       "customerID            str        0\n",
       "gender                str        0\n",
       "SeniorCitizen       int64        0\n",
       "Partner               str        0\n",
       "Dependents            str        0\n",
       "tenure              int64        0\n",
       "PhoneService          str        0\n",
       "MultipleLines         str        0\n",
       "InternetService       str        0\n",
       "OnlineSecurity        str        0\n",
       "OnlineBackup          str        0\n",
       "DeviceProtection      str        0\n",
       "TechSupport           str        0\n",
       "StreamingTV           str        0\n",
       "StreamingMovies       str        0\n",
       "Contract              str        0\n",
       "PaperlessBilling      str        0\n",
       "PaymentMethod         str        0\n",
       "MonthlyCharges    float64        0\n",
       "TotalCharges          str        0\n",
       "Churn                 str        0\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "missing = df.isna().sum()\n",
     "dtypes = df.dtypes.astype(str)\n",
     "summary = pd.DataFrame({\"dtype\": dtypes, \"missing\": missing})\n",
     "print(summary.to_string())\n"
    ],
    "id": "a4eff2b6"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 2. 目标变量：流失是否平衡\n",
     "\n",
     "整体流失率 26.54%，属于典型的**类别不平衡**场景——这也是后续评估指标要用 PR-AUC 而不是只看准确率的原因。"
    ],
    "id": "164b4a3f"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 3,
    "metadata": {},
    "outputs": [
     {
      "output_type": "stream",
      "name": "stdout",
      "text": [
       "Churn\n",
       "No     5174\n",
       "Yes    1869\n",
       "\n",
       "流失率: 26.54%  （正负样本比约 1 : 2.77）\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "vc = df[\"Churn\"].value_counts()\n",
     "rate = (df[\"Churn\"] == \"Yes\").mean()\n",
     "print(vc.to_string())\n",
     "print(f\"\\n流失率: {rate:.2%}  （正负样本比约 1 : {vc['No'] / vc['Yes']:.2f}）\")\n"
    ],
    "id": "7461aa82"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 3. 数值字段分布\n",
     "\n",
     "`tenure` 右偏（大量新客），`MonthlyCharges` 呈多峰（不同服务组合的价档），`TotalCharges` 随在网时长累积。"
    ],
    "id": "7a919f9e"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 4,
    "metadata": {},
    "outputs": [
     {
      "output_type": "stream",
      "name": "stdout",
      "text": [
       "        tenure  MonthlyCharges  TotalCharges\n",
       "count  7043.00         7043.00       7032.00\n",
       "mean     32.37           64.76       2283.30\n",
       "std      24.56           30.09       2266.77\n",
       "min       0.00           18.25         18.80\n",
       "25%       9.00           35.50        401.45\n",
       "50%      29.00           70.35       1397.48\n",
       "75%      55.00           89.85       3794.74\n",
       "max      72.00          118.75       8684.80\n",
       "\n",
       "TotalCharges 空白数: 11\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "num = df[[\"tenure\", \"MonthlyCharges\"]].copy()\n",
     "num[\"TotalCharges\"] = pd.to_numeric(df[\"TotalCharges\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n",
     "print(num.describe(percentiles=[.25, .5, .75]).round(2).to_string())\n",
     "print(\"\\nTotalCharges 空白数:\", int(num['TotalCharges'].isna().sum()))\n"
    ],
    "id": "5c804f00"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 4. 关键类别字段的取值分布\n",
     "\n",
     "合同类型、支付方式、网络类型是后续归因的三个主维度。"
    ],
    "id": "55d6b236"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": 5,
    "metadata": {},
    "outputs": [
     {
      "output_type": "stream",
      "name": "stdout",
      "text": [
       "--- Contract ---\n",
       "Contract\n",
       "Month-to-month    55.02\n",
       "Two year          24.07\n",
       "One year          20.91 \n",
       "\n",
       "--- PaymentMethod ---\n",
       "PaymentMethod\n",
       "Electronic check             33.58\n",
       "Mailed check                 22.89\n",
       "Bank transfer (automatic)    21.92\n",
       "Credit card (automatic)      21.61 \n",
       "\n",
       "--- InternetService ---\n",
       "InternetService\n",
       "Fiber optic    43.96\n",
       "DSL            34.37\n",
       "No             21.67 \n",
       "\n"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "source": [
     "for col in [\"Contract\", \"PaymentMethod\", \"InternetService\"]:\n",
     "    dist = df[col].value_counts(normalize=True).mul(100).round(2)\n",
     "    print(f\"--- {col} ---\")\n",
     "    print(dist.to_string(), \"\\n\")\n"
    ],
    "id": "1d49330f"
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {},
    "source": [
     "## 5. 数据质量小结\n",
     "\n",
     "| 检查项 | 结果 | 处理 |\n",
     "|---|---|---|\n",
     "| 行数 × 列数 | 7,043 × 21 | — |\n",
     "| 主键重复 | 0 | 无需去重 |\n",
     "| `TotalCharges` 空白 | 11 条（在网 0 个月的新客） | 按 `月租 × 在网月数` 回填 |\n",
     "| `TotalCharges` 类型 | object | 转 float |\n",
     "| 类别不平衡 | 26.54% 正样本 | 建模用 `class_weight` + PR-AUC |\n",
     "\n",
     "下一步：`02_churn_drivers.ipynb` 用 pandas 复现报告里的五条业务结论。\n"
    ],
    "id": "ef189e58"
   }
  ],
